  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b8f64f1b09abd27448ea5f6837581b24, type: 3}
  m_Name: EntryDialogue_Phase4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  localizations:
  - language: 0
    lines:
    - Yeah, cadet, you actually had a great teacher.
    - "I\u2019m so proud of myself!"
    - "But don\u2019t go thinking it\u2019s going to be that easy, huh?!"
    - Like Mom used to say, 'if you want it easy, sit on the pudding'!
    - "But don\u2019t worry, cadet, I\u2019ll give you a little help\u2026"
    - Pick out a decent upgrade for that old clunker of yours!
  - language: 1
    lines:
    - "\xC9, cadete, voc\xEA at\xE9 que teve um \xF3timo professor"
    - "To t\xE3o orgulhoso de mim!"
    - "Mas vai achando que vai ser facinho assim n\xE3o, hein?!"
    - "J\xE1 dizia mam\xE3e: quer moleza, senta no pudim!"
    - "Mas pode ficar tranquilo, cadete, vou te dar uma colher de ch\xE1..."
    - Escolhe um upgrade decente para essa sua caranga
